	"notice": "Incoming mixer controls and outgoing controller-mode CCs are different maps. Included controls are incoming track volume on channels 1-6 and main output volume on channel 7; controller-mode faders transmit CC1-6 on channel 1. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams show selected physical controls schematically, not a complete panel inventory. Unbound controls do not imply fixed MIDI assignments.",
